{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! Prepare thyself for a journey most grand a tale of wonder I shall weave.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Brightness**\n\nUpon arrival at Narita's gate a sight to behold\nThy journey doth commence a story to unfold.\nTo Shinjuku's heights ascend with eager pace\nAnd witness neon glory in this bustling place.\nDine upon ramen steaming hot and bold\nA culinary delight a tale to be told.\n\n**Day Two: Culture and Tradition in Tokyo**\n\nVisit the Meiji Shrine a haven serene\nWhere ancient spirits dwell a peaceful scene.\nExplore the vibrant streets of Shibuya's core\nA human river flowing evermore.\nThen wander through Harajuku's fashion craze\nA spectacle of style in a dazzling haze.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Grace**\n\nJourney forth to Hakone a mountain's embrace\nWhere art and nature intertwine with grace.\nCruise upon Lake Ashi a vista so fair\nWith Mount Fuji's peak a breath of fresh air.\nVisit the Hakone Open-Air Museum a wondrous show\nSculptures and landscapes in a gentle flow.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nHie thee to Kyoto a city of old\nWhere history whispers stories to be told.\nVisit Fushimi Inari's gates of vermilion bright\nA pathway to heavens bathed in golden light.\nExplore Kiyomizu-dera a temple so grand\nWith panoramic views across the land.\n\n**Day Five: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nMarvel at Kinkaku-ji a golden delight\nReflecting in waters a truly wondrous sight.\nFind solace in Ryoan-ji's rock garden deep\nWhere contemplation's secrets gently sleep.\nWander through Gion's streets a geisha's domain\nA glimpse of elegance a mystical refrain.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we venture a city of deer\nFriendly creatures roaming banishing fear.\nVisit Todai-ji Temple a giant's domain\nHousing Buddha's statue a sight to gain.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha a shrine of stone and light\nA path of lanterns burning ever so bright.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell to Sun**\n\nThy journey nears its end a bittersweet sigh\nAs memories linger beneath the Japanese sky.\nReturn to Narita's gate with heart full of glee\nA tale of Japan for all eternity.\nFarewell dear traveler may fortune attend\nUntil thy next adventure a journey to transcend.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0071897506713867}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.007763806264847517}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.9573058485984802}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.3749626874923706}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -2.0265558760002023e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.0016538526397198439}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -8.95221673999913e-05}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.4277741312980652}, {"token": "▁Prepare", "logprob": -1.8094046115875244}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.18239083886146545}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.00020776021119672805}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.0020434230100363493}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.11508877575397491}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.024575699120759964}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.2826620936393738}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.34921202063560486}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -1.3405683040618896}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.24155768752098083}, {"token": "▁wonder", "logprob": -0.6807428598403931}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.2840498685836792}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.0004481264913920313}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.02996516041457653}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.1487347036600113}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.011577796190977097}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.00047803416964598}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.1177827194333